# Frontend Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values

# ============================================
# API CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
VITE_API_URL=https://localhost:5000

# ============================================
# NOTES
# ============================================
# This is the URL where your backend API is running.
# The backend dev server runs over HTTPS (see thusitha-backend/server.js and
# the /certs directory) - the webcam API requires a secure context and this
# keeps frontend/backend on the same scheme so API calls aren't blocked as
# mixed content. Usually you don't need to set this at all: services/api.js
# already detects localhost/LAN-IP access and builds the right URL itself.
# When deploying: https://your-api-domain.com
